    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from conventional thinking and solve the &quot;impossible&quot; puzzle! This is a simple line-drawing game, until...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phenomena beyond your past experience emerge in this world. When faced with one &quot;impossible&quot; level after another, keep refining your understanding of the constant rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Note from the Creator:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific revolutions lie in questioning anomalies. When light bends in a gravitational field, or when a single particle passes through both slits simultaneously, it is these \u201cunreasonable\u201d phenomena that gave rise to relativity and quantum mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lines Go attempts to turn this experience into gameplay. Here, every seemingly &quot;impossible&quot; puzzle is a doorway to new insights. Players will observe patterns, test hypotheses, and\u2014when faced with the \u201cimpossible\u201d\u2014reexamine everything they thought they knew, refining their understanding of the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pure knowledge-locked game: the fundamental rules behind levels never change. Once players grasp the underlying logic, they\u2019ll be able to achieve surprising results\u2014some of which even the creator didn\u2019t anticipate.</p>",
